@WordBuddy_Identity_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080
@token = <paste a JWT from /api/auth/login>
@adminToken = <paste an admin JWT>

### Register (time zone is optional)
POST {{WordBuddy_Identity_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "learner@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!",
  "displayName": "Learner",
  "ageGroup": "Adult",
  "timeZoneId": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### Set the caller time zone (WB-29)
PUT {{WordBuddy_Identity_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/profile/time-zone
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timeZoneId": "America/New_York" }

### Grant the Guardian role (admin only, adult accounts only) (WB-29)
PUT {{WordBuddy_Identity_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/guardian
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isGuardian": true }

### Backfill LearnerProfileUpdated for all users (admin only, safe to rerun) (WB-29)
POST {{WordBuddy_Identity_Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/admin/learner-profiles/republish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
